TEXT 64 -656 Left 5 ;In this example the pv_slack_ctrl2 (pretty_pv_slack_op.asy) model is used (in this model set limit by hand)\nThe real power of pv-slack U11 is set to -250e6 the real power of U10 to -500e6\nThe lower q limit of pv-slack U11 is set to -140e6  (externally by hand)\nThe lower q limit of pv-slack U10 is set to -250e6 the upper limit to -180e6  (externally by hand)\nBefore the simulation the pv slack is used without set limits ( qvar pin = 1, qmin=0, qmax=0 )\nAfter detecting the time of the limits set vctrl PWL voltage sources \nAfter that resimulate the circuit for fine tuning
TEXT -208 -200 Left 2 !.param tdv=1 tdt=1 fn1=50 omega_n={2*pi*fn1}
TEXT 752 488 Left 2 ;Now qf  is altered from -0.3 to3.0  by step of 0.01\naditionally active power of pv element below is altered\nfrom -250e6 to -50e6 in five steps (1655 values simulated !!!!)
TEXT -280 208 Left 2 !vvmag vmag 0 410000\nvp p 0 {p}
TEXT 1168 -448 Left 2 !vvmag1 vmag1 0 405000\nvp1 p1 0 -500e6
